{"id":575,"date":"2015-04-17T14:57:48","date_gmt":"2015-04-17T13:57:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=575"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:03:23","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:03:23","slug":"vos-demarches","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/vos-demarches\/","title":{"rendered":"Vos d\u00e9marches"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Vous pouvez effectuer les principales d\u00e9marches administratives r\u00e9alisables en ligne en cliquant ci-dessous :<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/mon.service-public.fr\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-579\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/logo_monservicepublic-300x60.png\" alt=\"logo_monservicepublic\" width=\"300\" height=\"60\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/logo_monservicepublic-300x60.png 300w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/logo_monservicepublic-200x40.png 200w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/logo_monservicepublic-276x55.png 276w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/logo_monservicepublic.png 365w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p><strong>\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<h4>Etat civil\/population<\/h4>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Acc\u00e9der au t\u00e9l\u00e9service de <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.service-public.fr\/particuliers\/vosdroits\/R1406\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">demandes d\u2019actes d\u2019\u00e9tat civil en ligne<\/a><\/strong> (acte de naissance, mariage ou d\u00e9c\u00e8s survenu en France)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Acc\u00e9der au t\u00e9l\u00e9service de <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/mdel.mon.service-public.fr\/mademarchev5\/sfjsp?interviewID=JeChangeDeCoordonnees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">changement d\u2019adresse<\/a><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Acc\u00e9drer au t\u00e9l\u00e9service de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.service-public.fr\/particuliers\/vosdroits\/R16396\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>demande d\u2019inscription sur les listes \u00e9lectorales<\/strong><\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Acc\u00e9der au t\u00e9l\u00e9service de <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/mdel.mon.service-public.fr\/recensement-citoyen.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">recensement citoyen<\/a>\u00a0<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Vous pouvez payer vos factures en vous munissant de l&rsquo;avis des sommes \u00e0 payer que vous avez re\u00e7u et en cliquant ci-dessous :<\/p>\n<p>Depuis le 20 octobre 2020, le nom de domaine de l&rsquo;application PayFiP est op\u00e9rationnel via <a href=\"http:\/\/www.payfip.gouv.fr\/\">www.payfip.gouv.fr<\/a> (anciennement Tipi).<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Certaines d\u00e9marches sp\u00e9cifiques \u00e0 la ville de Hoenheim se trouvent ici :<\/p>\n<p>PARTICULIERS<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/timbres.impots.gouv.fr\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Timbres fiscaux<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Services-scolaires-Inscription-scolaire.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Services scolaires &#8211; Inscription scolaire<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Services-p\u00e9riscolaires-Restauration-scolaire.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Services p\u00e9riscolaires &#8211; Restauration scolaire<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/06\/Services-p\u00e9riscolaires-Garderies-p\u00e9riscolaires.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Services p\u00e9riscolaires &#8211; Inscriptions garderies p\u00e9riscolaires<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Service-jeunesse-Autorisation-parentale-activit\u00e9s-\u00e9t\u00e9.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Service jeunesse &#8211; Activit\u00e9s \u00e9t\u00e9 jeune<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Service scolaire &#8211; Inscriptions garderie vacances<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Ecole-de-musique-Inscriptions.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ecole de musique &#8211; Inscriptions<\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>ASSOCIATIONS<\/p>\n<p><a title=\"Demande de subvention communale\" href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/article-pas-en-avant\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Demande de subventions<\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>ENTREPRISES<\/p>\n<p><a title=\"TLPE\" href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/tlpe\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Taxe Locale sur la Publicit\u00e9 Ext\u00e9rieure<\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>VOIRIE<\/p>\n<p><a title=\"OCCUPATION DU DOMAINE PUBLIC\" href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/titre-patrick\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Demande d&rsquo;occupation de voirie<\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Vous pouvez effectuer les principales d\u00e9marches administratives r\u00e9alisables en ligne en cliquant ci-dessous : \u00a0 Etat civil\/population &nbsp; Acc\u00e9der au t\u00e9l\u00e9service de demandes d\u2019actes d\u2019\u00e9tat civil en ligne (acte de naissance, mariage ou d\u00e9c\u00e8s survenu en France) Acc\u00e9der au t\u00e9l\u00e9service de changement d\u2019adresse Acc\u00e9drer au t\u00e9l\u00e9service de demande d\u2019inscription sur les listes \u00e9lectorales Acc\u00e9der au [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"","_expiration-date":0,"_expiration-date-type":"","_expiration-date-categories":[],"_expiration-date-options":[]},"categories":[79],"tags":[98,185,183,184,167,186],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/575"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\